Case 2: stdenv + wrapProgram
Save as desk-tool-stdenv.nix:
# desk-tool-stdenv.nix
{ lib, stdenv, makeWrapper, curl, jq }:

stdenv.mkDerivation {
  pname = "desk-tool";
  version = "1.0.0";
  src = ./.;
  dontUnpack = true;
  nativeBuildInputs = [ makeWrapper ];
  installPhase = ''
    mkdir -p $out/bin
    echo '#!/bin/sh' &gt; $out/bin/desk-tool
