Case 1: Hermetic Go tests
Save as service.nix:
# service.nix
{ pkgs ? import &lt;nixpkgs&gt; { } }:

pkgs.buildGoModule {
  pname = "desk-service";
  version = "1.0.0";
  src = pkgs.lib.cleanSource ./.;
