One file returns the attr set, not an image. Both builders take that set:
# image-args.nix
{ pkgs, deskApp }:

{
  name = "desk-api";
  tag = "1.0.0";
  copyToRoot = [ deskApp pkgs.cacert pkgs.dockerTools.fakeNss ];
  extraCommands = ''
    mkdir -p tmp
