Case 5: sops creation rules share the same people
Save as .sops.yaml (desk, not their file):
# .sops.yaml
keys:
  - &alice age1qqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqq2w4k7f
  - &bob   age1qqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqp9z7n0h
creation_rules:
  - path_regex: secrets/core/.*
